# Scarcity Isle (#2750): one wish that needs no model. The Apprentice reads the words with its local matcher and offers
# a ready-made make; pressing the top tile grants it at once, with no agent anywhere.
@intent a player on Scarcity Isle wishes for supplies through the Apprentice and gets them, with no model
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat How to use Moddy within 90s
@repeat 30 until execute if entity @s[y=60,dy=12]
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @s[y=60,dy=12]
clear @s

@step the Apprentice offers a make
moddy apprentice a stack of oak logs
@expect screen Container within 10s
@shot apprentice-page

@step he presses the top tile
@click slot 0
@repeat 20 until execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_log
@wait 1s
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* minecraft:oak_log
@shot granted
